Ideas only, no code copied. These open-source projects informed the design:
- https://github.com/ankitects/anki (licence listed as "other" by GitHub; consult its licence files): self-grading after revealing a card. Last push: 2026-10-26.
- https://github.com/h16nning/skola (AGPL-3.0): local-first storage in the browser, no account required. Last push: 2026-07-12.
- https://github.com/wetterkrank/dasbot (MIT): a dedicated der/die/das article drill with spaced repetition. Last push: 2026-10-20.
- https://github.com/proycon/vocage (GPL-3.0): minimal vocabulary review. Last push: 2024-07-06; historical reference, not recently active.
- https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/ts-fsrs (MIT): separating review scheduling from the interface and testing scheduler behavior. Last push: 2026-10-25. This app uses its own fixed Leitner intervals, not FSRS.

